=2 Walkthrough
* Once you accept the assignment, the {n:Task Delegator} will provide you with a {k:Mor. FS building mat. container} to deliver to a Station Administrator in {z:Morimar Basalt Fields}.
** As of the {p:Feb. 18 2014 Version Update|http://forum.square-enix.com/ffxi/threads/40059-Feb-18-2014-%28JST%29-Version-Update?p=493165&viewfull=1#post493165}, Waypoints can now be used to complete this task without risk of break. Simply warp to a Station Administrator.

+ Zone to {z:Eastern Adoulin} from {z:Western Adoulin} at (M-8).
+ Travel to (G-5) in {z:Eastern Adoulin} and talk to {n:Lamaron} to be sent to {z:Yahse Hunting Grounds}.
+ Travel north to (H-5) in {z:Yahse Hunting Grounds} and zone to {z:Moh Gates}.
+ Travel north to (G-5) in {z:Moh Gates} and zone to {z:Morimar Basalt Fields}. Be advised that there appears to be a {m:Cave Panopt} in the first small room that aggros through {s:Sneak} and {p:Invisible (Status)}.
+ From the entrance of {z:Morimar Basalt Fields}, follow the path to (K-10) and speak to the {n:Station Administrator} to complete the assignment.

* Return to the {n:Task Delegator} to receive your reward.

=2 Notes
* {p:http://forum.square-enix.com/ffxi/threads/40059-Feb-18-2014-%28JST%29-Version-Update?p=493165&viewfull=1#post493165}
* Movement speed increasing effects recommended.
* Completing this assignment presumably aids with the construction of the Frontier Station in {z:Morimar Basalt Fields}.

